WEBVTT

00:00:00.487 --> 00:00:01.162
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:03.782 --> 00:00:09.881
<v><b>A:</b></v> Oh look! An Inter Milan football shirt. It’s perfect for Johnny!

00:00:09.882 --> 00:00:14.667
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, good idea. Oh… it’s very expensive.

00:00:15.053 --> 00:00:17.871
<v><b>A:</b></v> Football shirts are always expensive.

00:00:18.592 --> 00:00:22.111
OK. What we can get for Jessica?

00:00:22.456 --> 00:00:24.067
<v><b>B:</b></v> She likes football, too.

00:00:24.328 --> 00:00:27.354
<v><b>A:</b></v> Yes, but she never wears football shirts.

00:00:29.022 --> 00:00:30.902
What about this bag?

00:00:31.253 --> 00:00:34.086
<v><b>B:</b></v> I don’t know. Does she like bags?

00:00:34.087 --> 00:00:36.087
<v><b>A:</b></v> She loves bags…

00:00:39.028 --> 00:00:39.733
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:40.959 --> 00:00:43.620
<v><b>A:</b></v> Tom, do I need my swimming things?

00:00:43.734 --> 00:00:46.360
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, the hotel’s near the beach.

00:00:46.994 --> 00:00:49.189
Can you see my phone charger?

00:00:49.366 --> 00:00:51.073
<v><b>A:</b></v> Yes, here it is.

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:55.139
Do you want me to put it in the suitcase or in your bag?

00:00:55.542 --> 00:00:58.167
<v><b>B:</b></v> In my bag, please. Thanks.

00:01:01.090 --> 00:01:01.816
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:01:05.338 --> 00:01:07.655
<v><b>A:</b></v> Good morning. How can I help you?

00:01:07.766 --> 00:01:15.335
<v><b>B:</b></v> Hello, I want a car for three days, please – for today, Tuesday and Wednesday.

00:01:15.586 --> 00:01:19.530
<v><b>A:</b></v> No problem, what kind of car would you like?

00:01:19.802 --> 00:01:22.587
<v><b>B:</b></v> A small car is fine. It’s just me.

00:01:23.966 --> 00:01:26.846
<v><b>A:</b></v> Is a Honda Jazz OK?

00:01:27.069 --> 00:01:28.024
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, great.

00:01:28.625 --> 00:01:30.327
<v><b>A:</b></v> Can I see your driving licence?

00:01:30.362 --> 00:01:31.856
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, here you are.

00:01:36.004 --> 00:01:36.722
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:01:39.946 --> 00:01:41.849
<v><b>A:</b></v> Is that a number 13?

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:43.573
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes. I think it is.

00:01:44.326 --> 00:01:46.326
No, it’s a 23.

00:01:46.327 --> 00:01:47.872
<v><b>A:</b></v> Another 23?

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:52.264
I don’t believe it! That’s the third one. And no 13.

00:01:56.427 --> 00:01:57.927
<v><b>B:</b></v> Another one’s coming now.

00:01:58.423 --> 00:02:02.289
Let’s see. Yes. That’s a 13.

00:02:02.593 --> 00:02:03.733
<v><b>A:</b></v> At last!